DTSTAMP:20261113T080400Z
DTSTART:20261121T235000Z
DTEND:20261122T000000Z
SUMMARY:Metro: Ginza Line\, Asakusa → Ueno
DESCRIPTION:Tokyo Metro Ginza Line from Asakusa G19 toward 渋谷 Shibuya\, 3 stops to Ueno G16\, then about 6 min on foot to Grids. Leave Asakusa by 08:40. Check out and leave by 09:05: Keisei-Ueno is about 9 min on foot with suitcases.
LOCATION:Ueno Station
