BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:jp-trip-22-1795307040000@trip
DTSTAMP:20261113T080400Z
DTSTART:20261122T002400Z
DTEND:20261122T010500Z
SUMMARY:Train: Skyliner about 09:20\, Keisei-Ueno → Airport Terminal 2·3\, about 10:01
DESCRIPTION:Skyliner from Keisei-Ueno (KS01) at about 09:20\, all seats reserved: book the exact train for Sun 22 Nov (Keisei renumbers the Skyliners on 21 Nov). Get off at 空港第2ビル Airport Terminal 2·3 (KS41)\, about 41 min later. Go up to the departures floor and leave the suitcases at a baggage storage counter (手荷物一時預かり)\, about ¥1\,000 a suitcase for the day (est.\; not checked).
LOCATION:Narita Airport Terminal 2
