SUMMARY:Bus: Bus from T2 stop 28 to Shisui Premium Outlets
DESCRIPTION:From the T2 arrivals floor (1F) go out to bus stop 28: the direct bus for 酒々井プレミアム・アウトレット\, about 15–18 min\; pay by IC card or cash (about ¥500\, est.). Times are not checked: look them up for Sunday and take the first after 10:10.
LOCATION:Shisui Premium Outlets
