DESCRIPTION:Meet at the outlet bus stop by 12:35 and take the bus for 成田空港\, about 18 min to Terminal 2\; if it runs every 30 min\, the one after is still in time. Collect the suitcases\, then the customs tax-refund kiosk before the 13:25 check-in.
LOCATION:Narita Airport Terminal 2
